    "text": "<blockquote><p>The work done is given by the area of the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>V</mi></math>&nbsp;graph of the loop.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>E</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>C</mi></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>D</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></msub><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math></p></blockquote>"
